# A screw thread's tolerance class chosen from its list, and its phase
# typed (an extension).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The phase.
twmove 426 150
twdown L 426 150
twup L 426 150
edit 90
# The class's [choose] lists the classes of an external metric thread.
twmove 687 170
twdown L 687 170
twup L 687 170
tw
# 6h, then back to the thread, which shows the class's clearance.
twmove 356 140
twdown L 356 140
twup L 356 140
twmove 57 190
twdown L 57 190
twup L 57 190
tw
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part, then made.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
tw
dump
